    <title>不务正野Vol.18｜广州封控一个月了，我都干了些啥啊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6390b52c0d56158ecbb89b0f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6390b52c0d56158ecbb89b0f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 07 Dec 2022 15:45:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>感谢收听野生喜剧出品播客《不务正野》第十八期～</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：@王飞 &nbsp;本期嘉宾 @加钱 @噗噗@橙酱</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期话题：广州封控一个月了，我都干了些啥啊</span></p><span></span><p><span>被封了一个月后，我们又回来啦！！这一期和野人即兴团成员聊聊这个月都是怎么过的啊啊～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">1:44</a> 在深圳去了很多开放麦，也没写啥好的新段子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">3:40</a> 广州野生喜剧也有 PK赛了朋友们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="358">5:58</a> 3v3找到你的喜剧伙伴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="576">9:36</a> 流浪喜剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="843">14:03</a> 在家办工就是想办就办，不想办就不办</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1088">18:08</a> &nbsp;水马被推倒了又拿铁条封起来了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1088">18:08</a> 封完后就被辞退了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1387">23:07</a> 现在的大学生还有青春吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1727">28:47</a> 有个大哥真牛，不想隔离，从深圳高铁站逃出去了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2190">36:30</a> 愿望就是努力保住这份工吧</span></p>]]></description>
