    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>感谢收听野生喜剧出品播客《不务正野》第十三期～</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：@王飞 &nbsp;本期嘉宾 @陈沉尘 @马小羊 @付二</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期话题：出轨和开放式关系（上）</span></p><span></span><p><span>你会怀疑你的对象出轨吗？精神出轨和肉体出轨，哪一个你更不能接受？性和爱能分开吗？你接受开放式关系吗？这一期劲爆话题，赶紧来听听～</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是本话题上期，下期内容我们敬请期待～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">3:30</a> 时间足够久，一定会出轨的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">4:45</a> 一个不好的开始，我会怀疑ta会出轨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">8:50</a> 我被小三了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 只要不让我发现，我能接受他出轨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 爱情福分，能量守恒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1255">20:55</a> 我遭过雷劈了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 到什么边界就是精神出轨了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> 马斯洛需求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2319">38:39</a> 出轨针对的是婚姻，谈恋爱没有轨</span></p>]]></description>
